  /// turn. Keeps the one-shot `continue` nudge semantics (issue #1085 M2b)
  /// unchanged.
  cleanEmpty,

  /// `StopReason.aborted`/`error` streams are never classified as empty —
  /// their own terminal paths own the run (the pre-existing guard, kept).
  abortedOrError,
